# W4-SQ-01: SOV02 beach landing with real orders. The amphibious transports
# arrive CARRYING the Rhinos and Conscripts (TeamType Full=yes), unload on the
# beach (Unload mode 1: the cargo leaves the team), and only the empty
# transports change house. The player keeps the landing force, sends the
# Rhinos at the beach pillboxes (the MCV chain itself: m-sov02-mcv.play).
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
set campaign sov02t.MAP Nod
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
until 60 carried(0) >= 6
until 1500 carried(0) == 0
assert units(0,HTNK) >= 6
assert units(0,E2) >= 12
wait 300
assert units(0,HTNK) >= 6
# The player's real orders: the Rhinos assault the beach pillboxes.
click unit 0:HTNK:0
click unit 0:HTNK:1 shift
click unit 0:HTNK:2 shift
click unit 0:HTNK:3 shift
assert selected >= 4
click building 1:GAPILL:0
wait 300
assert units(0,HTNK) >= 4
assert outcome == RUNNING
shot assault
end
